<section id="contact" class="py-14 md:py-16">
  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr]">
    <div class="section-wrap rounded-sm reveal">
      <p class="kicker">Contacto</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-[0.95] tracking-tight text-text sm:text-5xl">BUSCAS UN PROGRAMADOR FREELANCE PARA TU APP O PLATAFORMA WEB?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-textMuted sm:text-base">
        Escribeme y te ayudo a definir la mejor solucion para tu app movil, SaaS o web corporativa. Trabajo en remoto con empresas de toda España y clientes internacionales.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-textSoft">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Respuesta inicial en menos de 24 horas</p>
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Presupuesto cerrado y hoja de ruta tecnica</p>
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Desarrollo, lanzamiento y soporte continuo</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xvgzbajk" method="POST" class="rounded-sm border border-primary/40 bg-surface p-4 sm:p-8 reveal reveal-2">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <label for="first-name" class="block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-textLabel">Nombre</label>
        <div class="mt-2.5">
          <input type="text" name="first-name" id="first-name" autocomplete="given-name" class="block w-full rounded-sm border border-border bg-surfaceAlt py-2.5 px-3 text-text focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ringPrimary sm:text-sm sm:leading-6" required>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="last-name" class="block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-textLabel">Apellidos</label>
        <div class="mt-2.5">
          <input type="text" name="last-name" id="last-name" autocomplete="family-name" required class="block w-full rounded-sm border border-border bg-surfaceAlt py-2.5 px-3 text-text focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ringPrimary sm:text-sm sm:leading-6">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sm:col-span-2">
        <label for="company" class="block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-textLabel">Empresa</label>
        <div class="mt-2.5">
          <input type="text" name="company" id="company" autocomplete="organization" required class="block w-full rounded-sm border border-border bg-surfaceAlt py-2.5 px-3 text-text focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ringPrimary sm:text-sm sm:leading-6">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sm:col-span-2">
        <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-textLabel">Correo electrónico</label>
        <div class="mt-2.5">
          <input type="email" name="email" id="email" autocomplete="email" required class="block w-full rounded-sm border border-border bg-surfaceAlt py-2.5 px-3 text-text focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ringPrimary sm:text-sm sm:leading-6">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sm:col-span-2">
        <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-textLabel">Mensaje</label>
        <div class="mt-2.5">
          <textarea name="message" id="message" rows="5" required class="block w-full rounded-sm border border-border bg-surfaceAlt py-2.5 px-3 text-text focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ringPrimary sm:text-sm sm:leading-6" placeholder="Cuéntame tu objetivo, plazos y tipo de proyecto"></textarea>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sm:col-span-2">
        <label class="inline-flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-textSoft" for="privacy">
          <input id="privacy" type="checkbox" required class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-border bg-surfaceAlt text-primary focus:ring-ringPrimary" />
          <span>Al enviar este formulario, aceptas la política de privacidad.</span>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8">
        <button type="submit" class="block w-full rounded-sm bg-primary px-4 py-3 text-center text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-primaryStrong">
          Solicitar propuesta
        </button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>